      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Peace isn't about giving up; it's about finally stopping the exhausting performance of trying to be okay when you're not. That constant noise is just the friction of fighting a battle you were never meant to win. If you stop fighting, you stop the pain of the struggle, and that quiet space is where the real, honest rest begins.",
